{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11112140","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11112140","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1111214001:1":{"text":"Have you found Koko?","source_cn":"你们找到卡卡了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x588B52CEE89D2632","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111214002:1":{"text":"No, you didn't either, did you?","source_cn":"没有，你那边也没找到吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD56C7AB6201D5CBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111214003:1":{"text":"No, where could she be...?","source_cn":"是啊……到底跑到哪里去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74E39D6AA64E22B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111214004:1":{"text":"When children throw tantrums, they sometimes just want to hide and be by themselves.","source_cn":"小孩子闹脾气，肯定是躲起来了呗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42200F1FD7DA467A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111214005:1":{"text":"Antandra, since Koko is familiar with this area, we shouldn't be too worried, right?","source_cn":"安丹小姐，既然卡卡她对当地很熟悉，应该不需要特别担心吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x720CE3ACD4450A49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111214006:1":{"text":"To be honest, she's probably perched somewhere, watching us as we speak. We won't find her at this rate.","source_cn":"嗯……她可能正躲在暗处偷偷观察我们，这样下去是找不到的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE469F1659E20CC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111214007:1":{"text":"A child's anger comes and goes like a desert storm.","source_cn":"小孩子的怒火来去匆匆，就像这沙漠的天气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x891ECA8A9140391A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111214008:1":{"text":"When she gets hungry, then she'll show herself.","source_cn":"等她饿到肚子咕咕叫的时候，自然就会出来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x180A98E7DF400B5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111214009:1":{"text":"I took a quick look at her fortune. Prosperity and abundance are her future. She'll be fine.","source_cn":"看那孩子的模样，我就知道她是个幸运的家伙，不会有事的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A20DDAAF9419D08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111214010:1":{"text":"Alright, maybe I'm overthinking this.","source_cn":"好吧，或许是我多虑了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA814566141566B54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111214011:1":{"text":"I'm sorry I delayed us.","source_cn":"抱歉，因为我耽误了大家的行程。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5677986DE8AB209","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111214012:1":{"text":"I'll head back to the camp and leave a message, then we can depart.","source_cn":"我回营地给孩子们留个口信，之后我们马上出发。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x690558C14816B9BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:安丹德拉":{"text":"Antandra","source":"安丹德拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:萨忒娜":{"text":"Satrana","source":"萨忒娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}